{"unit_id":"58fly__dsh-language-guard#card-zh","repo":"58fly/dsh-language-guard","commit":"38411ebd24d29f02c10f319f56c1a6110a7daff7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-language-guard**（DSH 网页插件）：为推理、回复和工具调用描述加入指定语言约束。它在系统提示词首尾及强化档的中段注册约束文本，并提供自动或手动语言选择、B/C/D 三档强度、保留代码术语、自定义规则、周期提醒、设置卡片、侧栏快速切换和 `/language` 临时命令。适合希望 DSH 持续使用指定语言工作的用户；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:192-249","client.js:1422-1485"]}
{"unit_id":"58fly__dsh-language-guard#card-en","repo":"58fly/dsh-language-guard","commit":"38411ebd24d29f02c10f319f56c1a6110a7daff7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-language-guard** (DSH web plugin) adds chosen-language rules to system prompts. It supports automatic or manual language selection, three strength levels, custom rules, periodic reminders, a settings card, sidebar switching, and a temporary `/language` command. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:192-249","client.js:1422-1485"]}
